I won't even pretend to be okay,

8
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:51,100
偏見ばっかくだらない
prejudices are just so stupid.

9
00:04:51,100 --> 00:04:53,600
期待しないなんて嘘ばかり
Saying "I don't expect anything" is nothing but lies.

10
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:56,500
顔色伺い互いに気にして
Reading each other's expressions, worrying about one another...

11
00:04:56,500 --> 00:05:00,000
一人で踊ればいい
We might as well just dance alone.

12
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:01,308
戻れない
I can't go back...

13
