永遠なんてありゃしない
There's no such thing as eternity.

29
00:05:57,408 --> 00:05:59,608
健全なんて嘘ばかり
Being wholesome is nothing but a lie.

30
00:05:59,608 --> 00:06:02,108
期待したいなんてエゴばかり
Wanting to have expectations is pure selfishness.

31
00:06:02,108 --> 00:06:05,108
顔色伺いもギリギリ
Reading your face has reached its limit.

32
