はい はい 影ばかり
Yes, yes, only shadows.

62
00:08:06,008 --> 00:08:07,808
ないない
Nothing, nothing...

63
00:08:07,808 --> 00:08:09,508
応 応 遠回り
Yeah, yeah, a detour.

64
00:08:09,508 --> 00:08:11,308
相対 自分 不在
Relativity, my absence,

65
00:08:11,308 --> 00:08:13,908
どこにもいない
I am nowhere to be found.

66
00:08:13,908 --> 00:08:15,908
ないないじゃない
It's not like I don't exist.

67
00:08:16,808 --> 00:08:18,408
曖昧 迷い 愛
Vague, lost love,

68
00:08:18,408 --> 00:08:20,108
色のない藍
