70
00:08:21,808 --> 00:08:23,908
人ごとみたい
...it feels like someone else's business.

71
00:08:23,908 --> 00:08:27,108
おかげさま どちらさま
Thank goodness, who are you?

72
00:08:27,108 --> 00:08:31,008
応え様々
Answers vary.

73
00:08:31,108 --> 00:08:34,108
何者でもないまま
Without becoming anyone,

74
00:08:34,108 --> 00:08:38,008
何にもできないまま
unable to do anything,

75
00:08:38,008 --> 00:08:41,208
生きるのは無駄ですが
living is useless, but...

76
00:08:41,208 --> 00:08:45,008
悪いことですか
...is it a bad thing?

77
00:08:45,108 --> 00:08:49,108
ここにいないいないいないのは
The one who isn't, isn't, isn't here...

78
00:08:49,108 --> 00:08:52,508
自分 自分
...is me, myself.

79
00:08:53,108 --> 00:08:58,108
誰も見ない見ない見ないまま
While no one is looking, looking, looking,

80
00:08:58,108 --> 00:09:00,608
吐き捨ててサヨウナラ
spit it out and say goodbye.

81
00:09:00,608 --> 00:09:03,508
嬉しくない 哀しくもない
I'm not happy, nor am I sad.

82
00:09:03,508 --> 00:09:06,908
透明な気分
A transparent feeling.

83
00:09:06,908 --> 00:09:11,808
足りない自分 合わす顔もない
My lacking self has no face to show.

84
00:09:11,808 --> 00:09:14,608
ない
Nothing.

85
00:09:15,108 --> 00:09:18,108
笑えないじゃない
I can't even laugh.

86
00:09:20,208 --> 00:09:23,208
灰じゃない 藍合 閉じた眼
Not ash, meeting indigo, closed eyes.

87
