Cute, right? Once again, the new outfit. Right?

863
00:53:14,215 --> 00:53:18,715
みこちと、ぽるちゃんともね、歌えて嬉しい！
I'm so happy I got to sing with Mikochi and Pol-chan!

864
00:53:18,715 --> 00:53:24,215
まさかの、「ええっ！？」って思ってる人が出てもね、めっちゃ多かったと思うんだけど、お呼びしました、今回は。
I think many of you were surprised, wondering "What?!", but I invited them this time.

865
00:53:24,215 --> 00:53:28,215
嬉しいです。
I'm really happy.

866
00:53:28,215 --> 00:53:31,215
さあ、というわけで。
Now, with that said...

867
00:53:31,215 --> 00:53:36,715
もう、結構歌ったね！うーん。
We've sung quite a lot already! Yeah.

868
00:53:36,715 --> 00:53:41,715
なんか、そろそろウズウズしてる人たちが、いっぱいいる気がするの！
I feel like there are many people getting antsy around now!

869
00:53:41,715 --> 00:53:49,215
ウズウズウズウズウズウズ！どこが一番ウズウズしてる？
Ants, ants, antsy! Who's getting the most antsy?

870
00:53:49,215 --> 00:53:54,215
はい！というわけで、待ちができないので、ご紹介したいと思います。
All right! Since I can't wait, I'd like to introduce it.

871
00:53:54,215 --> 00:53:59,215
誕生日といえば？
Speaking of birthdays...

872
00:53:59,215 --> 00:54:04,715
誕生日グッズ！！！
Birthday merchandise!!!

873
00:54:04,715 --> 00:54:09,715
今回の誕生日グッズはこちら！
Here is the birthday merchandise for this time!

874
00:54:09,715 --> 00:54:13,215
はい！久々にタペストリーを出します。
Yes! It's been a while since I released a tapestry.

875
00:54:13,215 --> 00:54:16,715
まず1つ目。B2タペストリー！
First up, the B2 tapestry!

876
00:54:16,715 --> 00:54:20,715
こちらイラストはね、とてもクールな僕なんですけれども、
For this illustration, I look very cool, but...

877
00:54:20,715 --> 00:54:24,215
しゃがむ先生に描いていただきました！
it was drawn by Syagamu-sensei!

878
00:54:24,215 --> 00:54:30,715
あ、これ、龍違いとか言わないでね。龍、お前も好きだしお前も好きだぞ、みんな愛してる、龍です。
Ah, please don't say it's the wrong dragon. "I like you, and I like you too, I love you all" – it's that dragon.

879
00:54:30,715 --> 00:54:37,215
めっちゃかっこいいよね！
It's super cool, isn't it?

880
00:54:37,215 --> 00:54:42,715
強そうな龍と、強そうな僕。かっこいいでしょ？
A powerful-looking dragon and a powerful-looking me. Cool, right?

881
00:54:42,715 --> 00:54:45,215
そして、2つ目は？
And the second item is...

882
00:54:45,215 --> 00:54:50,215
なんとお腹いっぱいに食べちゃお餃子皿！
surprisingly, the "Eat Till You're Full Gyoza Plate"!

883
00:54:50,215 --> 00:54:55,215
なんと、こちら、ロボ子先生が描いてくれました！
Amazingly, this was drawn by Roboco-sensei!

884
00:54:55,215 --> 00:55:00,215
見て、なんか凄い、もう、
Look, it's really like, already...

885
00:55:00,236 --> 00:55:05,536
いっぱい食べる気満々の 沼にハマってるロボことロボさ めちゃめちゃ可愛いでしょう
Roboko and Robosa, who are stuck in the marsh and fully ready to eat, are super cute, right?

886
00:55:05,636 --> 00:55:11,436
このお皿を使っていっぱいね 餃子なり何なり食べてください
Please use this plate to eat lots of gyoza or whatever you like!

887
00:55:11,536 --> 00:55:15,536
お腹いっぱいになると幸せになるのでね
Because when you fill your stomach, you become happy.

888
00:55:15,636 --> 00:55:17,836
はい！そして次は？
Yes! And next is...

889
00:55:17,836 --> 00:55:21,236
ご飯を食べたら喉渇く
Once you eat, you get thirsty!

890
00:55:21,336 --> 00:55:23,736
ちあーず！グラスですね
It's the Cheers! Glass.

891
00:55:23,736 --> 00:55:29,036
ビール入れたっていいし お茶入れたっていいし ジュース入れたっていい
It's fine to put beer in it, tea in it, or juice in it!

892
00:55:29,036 --> 00:55:31,436
美味しいもの飲んでいきましょう！
Let's drink delicious things!

893
00:55:31,436 --> 00:55:35,736
こちらもなんとロボこ先生が描いてくれました 高性能だな
For this too, Roboko-sensei drew it. How high-spec!

894
00:55:35,736 --> 00:55:40,236
可愛いすぎる こんなウィンクされたらいっぱい飲んだったってね いいですから
It's way too cute! Getting winked at like this makes you want to drink a lot, which is fine!

895
00:55:44,436 --> 00:55:48,236
ぜひ、ええ、ご飯と飲み物
Please, with your meals and drinks...

896
00:55:48,236 --> 00:55:51,536
食卓にお使いくださいまし
...please use them at your dining table.

897
00:55:51,536 --> 00:55:55,436
今度僕も配信でね 使ってみようと思うので
I'm thinking of using them in my stream next time,

898
00:55:55,536 --> 00:55:58,436
ぜひチェックしてみてください
so please check them out.

899
00:55:58,436 --> 00:56:01,236
そして、まだまだあります！こちら、ドン！
And we still have more! Here, boom!

900
00:56:01,236 --> 00:56:06,236
はい！僕の大好きなぬいぐるみ！
Yes! My favorite plushie!

901
00:56:06,236 --> 00:56:09,436
本日も可愛いものができました
Another cute one is ready today.

902
00:56:09,436 --> 00:56:13,436
見て！お座りしてるの、今回の。お座りぬいぐるみ
Look! It's sitting down this time. A sitting plushie.

903
00:56:13,436 --> 00:56:17,536
ちゃんとロボサーもね、ここにいますよ（はい）
Robosa is also right here as well.

904
00:56:17,536 --> 00:56:21,236
はい。今回はね、お座りのぬいぐるみなので
Yes. Since it's a sitting plushie this time,

905
00:56:21,236 --> 00:56:25,236
そのままお部屋に飾ってもいいし
you can just display it in your room like this,

906
00:56:25,236 --> 00:56:28,236
お出かけでもね、一緒に写真撮りやすいのかなと思います
or take it out with you, as I think it'll be easy to take photos together.

907
00:56:28,236 --> 00:56:32,636
はい。いっぱい色んなところに連れてってあげてください
Yes. Please take it with you to many different places.

908
00:56:32,636 --> 00:56:36,036
大切にしてね。無くさないでね。置いていかないでね
Treasure it, okay? Don't lose it. Don't leave it behind!

909
00:56:36,036 --> 00:56:41,536
たくさん買ったっていいんだからね
You can buy as many as you want, you know!

910
00:56:41,536 --> 00:56:44,836
そして、ボイスも出ます！
And we also have voice packs!

911
00:56:44,836 --> 00:56:48,536
今回は、シチュエーションボイス「ぼく vs りゅう」
This time, it's the situation voice "Me vs. Dragon".

912
00:56:48,536 --> 00:56:51,536
まじで、りゅうの名前さ、定まらんのよね
Seriously, the dragon's name hasn't been finalized.

913
00:56:51,536 --> 00:56:56,236
みどりだっていいし、りゅうだっていいし、ドラゴンくんだっていいし、ドラちゃんだっていい。何だっていい
Midori is fine, Ryu is fine, Dragon-kun is fine, or Dora-chan is fine. Anything is fine!

914
00:56:56,236 --> 00:57:00,236
おお、いいよね、ね
Oh, that's great, right?

915
00:57:00,236 --> 00:57:04,236
はい、君に襲いかかるりゅうに、可愛さ勝負を挑む
Yes, challenging the dragon attacking you to a cuteness battle:

916
00:57:04,236 --> 00:57:07,736
僕のお話、キュン
my story, heart-fluttering!

917
00:57:07,736 --> 00:57:12,536
はい、どんなお話かはぜひ買って聞いてみてください
Yes, please purchase it and listen to find out what kind of story it is!

918
00:57:12,536 --> 00:57:15,736
さぁ、最後に、こちら！
Now, finally, this one!

919
00:57:15,736 --> 00:57:21,236
はい、今回のフルセット購入特典についてお話しします
Yes, I will talk about the full-set purchase bonuses this time.

920
00:57:21,236 --> 00:57:24,236
えーまず1つ目
First, the first one:

921
00:57:24,236 --> 00:57:27,736
えー数量限定版が、今回はあります"
There is a limited-quantity version this time!

922
00:57:27,736 --> 00:57:30,236
数量限定版は、僕の直筆サインと
The limited-quantity version includes my handwritten autograph and...

923
00:57:30,236 --> 00:57:36,036
箔押しの複製メッセージ入りのポストカードになります
...a postcard with a foil-stamped duplicate message.

924
00:57:36,036 --> 00:57:39,736
はい。ぜひ、今回は僕のこの配信が終わったと
Yes. This time, right after my stream ends,

925
00:57:39,736 --> 00:57:43,236
同時にカートがオープンしますので
the cart will open simultaneously,

926
00:57:43,236 --> 00:57:45,236
そのタイミングで、ぜひ狙ってみてください
so please try to aim for that timing.

927
00:57:45,236 --> 00:57:50,236
スタートダッシュの準備はいいか
Are you ready for a head start?

928
00:57:50,236 --> 00:57:53,236
ぜひゲットしてくださいね
Please be sure to get it!

929
00:57:53,236 --> 00:57:56,736
はい、もちろん通常版もあります。通常版は
Yes, of course, there is also a regular version. The regular version

930
00:57:56,736 --> 00:58:00,236
僕の直筆サインはないんですけど、箔押し入りのね
doesn't have my handwritten autograph, but it has a foil-stamped...

931
00:58:00,236 --> 00:58:05,636
サインとメッセージのポストカードがついてきますので、ぜひゲットしてください
...autograph and message postcard, so please get it!

932
00:58:05,636 --> 00:58:09,736
そして、まだフルセット購入特典には
And furthermore, the full-set purchase bonuses also include

933
00:58:09,736 --> 00:58:12,236
ボイスがつきます
bonus voices.

934
00:58:12,236 --> 00:58:15,236
1つ目「きみとりゅうとよるのそら」
The first one is "You, the Dragon, and the Night Sky".

935
00:58:15,236 --> 00:58:19,236
こちらは販売ボイスのね、少しあ後の時間帯のお話で
This is a story set a little bit after the main voice pack's events,

936
00:58:19,236 --> 00:58:22,736
なんと時間軸が続いております
and believe it or not, the timeline is connected!

937
00:58:22,736 --> 00:58:26,236
販売ボイスは、別に単体でも楽しめますけど
You can enjoy the main voice pack on its own,

938
00:58:26,236 --> 00:58:30,236
特典ボイスも合わせると
but if you also listen to the bonus voice,

939
00:58:30,236 --> 00:58:34,036
「え、あのあ後の続きがあるの？」って楽しめので、ぜひ聞いてほしいです
you can enjoy it thinking, "Oh, there's a continuation after that?" So please listen!

940
00:58:34,036 --> 00:58:36,736
面白いよ
It's really fun!

941
00:58:36,736 --> 00:58:40,236
そして、なんと、今回は、じゃん！
And surprisingly, this time, ta-da!

942
00:58:40,236 --> 00:58:44,736
タレントプレミアムグッズのフルセット特典として
As a full-set purchase bonus for the talent premium goods,

943
00:58:44,736 --> 00:58:49,236
2024年から、9月から発売がされた
which started selling in September 2024,

944
00:58:49,236 --> 00:58:53,536
「hololive OFFICIAL CARD GAME」で使用できるカードが、1枚ついてきます
you will get one card that can be used in the "hololive OFFICIAL CARD GAME"!

945
00:58:53,536 --> 00:58:56,736
同梱するカードは
The included card is

946
00:58:56,736 --> 00:59:00,236
ホロライブプロダクションオフィシャルショップで購入された
only for customers who purchase it on the

947
00:59:00,236 --> 00:59:02,536
お客様のみの対象となります
Hololive Production Official Shop.

948
00:59:02,536 --> 00:59:05,736
今回特典につくのは
The card included as a bonus this time

949
00:59:05,736 --> 00:59:10,736
ゲームで、1枚だけ使用でき、推しをアピールすることができるカード
is an Oshi Holomem Card where you can use just one in a game to show off your favorite member,

950
00:59:10,736 --> 00:59:14,536
「推しホロメンカード」です！
the "Oshi Holomem Card"!

951
00:59:14,536 --> 00:59:17,536
みんな欲しいっしょ、これ
You all want this, right?

952
00:59:17,536 --> 00:59:19,636
1枚、今しか買えない
This single card is only available now!

953
00:59:19,636 --> 00:59:22,036
ロボサーは買うべき
Robosa definitely should buy it.

954
00:59:22,036 --> 00:59:24,236
強いよ！
It's really strong!

955
00:59:24,236 --> 00:59:26,236
はい、というわけで
Okay, so anyway,

956
00:59:26,236 --> 00:59:30,236
カードの詳細や遊び方については
regarding the card's details and how to play,

957
00:59:30,236 --> 00:59:33,236
多分、僕から聞くより
rather than hearing it from me,

958
00:59:33,236 --> 00:59:36,736
「hololive OFFICIAL CARD GAME」の公式ホームページで確認した方が
checking the "hololive OFFICIAL CARD GAME" official website

959
00:59:36,736 --> 00:59:40,236
分かりやすいと思うので、ぜひチェックしてみてください
would be easier to understand, so please check it out.

960
00:59:40,236 --> 00:59:44,436
はい、同梱するカードは日本語版のみとなりますのでご了承ください
Yes, please note that the included card is Japanese-version only.

961
00:59:44,436 --> 00:59:47,536
No English, sorry.

962
00:59:47,536 --> 00:59:52,236
グッズのカートオープンは、このあと配信終了後になりますので
The merchandise cart will open right after this stream ends,

963
00:59:52,236 --> 00:59:54,736
みんな！
so everyone,

964
00:59:54,736 --> 00:59:57,236
待機して買ってね！
please wait on standby and buy it!

965
00:59:57,236 --> 00:59:59,236
いっぱい買ったっていい！
It's totally fine to buy lots of them!

966
01:00:00,257 --> 01:00:01,557
そして！
And...

967
01:00:01,557 --> 01:00:03,457
この後はなんと！
...what's coming up next is...

968
01:00:04,257 --> 01:00:06,257
実は初めての
...actually, for the first time...

969
01:00:06,257 --> 01:00:09,757
メインエ、アル、ア、イ、
...a Main E- Al- A- I...

970
01:00:09,757 --> 01:00:12,757
アンコールライブがあります！
There will be an encore live!

971
01:00:12,957 --> 01:00:15,757
お酒は飲んでも 飲まれるな！
You can drink alcohol, but don't let it drink you!

972
01:00:15,757 --> 01:00:17,757
私、今日お酒飲んでない！
I haven't had any alcohol today!

973
01:00:17,757 --> 01:00:20,757
ふふふふ！
Hehehe!

974
01:00:20,757 --> 01:00:25,257
えー、アンコールとアルコール似てるんだわ！
Encore and alcohol sound so similar!

975
01:00:25,257 --> 01:00:30,057
はい、というわけで、なんと今回はね、アンコールライブがありますので！
Yes, so this time, we have an encore live!

976
01:00:30,057 --> 01:00:35,257
アンコールライブはね、みんながずっと僕に歌ってほしそうだった、あの曲を歌っちゃおうかなと思ってますので、
For the encore live, I think I'll sing that song everyone has wanted me to sing for a long time.

977
01:00:35,257 --> 01:00:39,057
楽しみにしててくださーい！
So look forward to it!

978
01:00:39,257 --> 01:00:43,257
なんか、せっかくだからね、写真撮影会とかね、ロボサーと密な空間で、
And since we are here, in a cozy space with the Robosa, with a photo session...

979
01:00:43,257 --> 01:00:48,257
いっぱい見せちゃおうかなって、思っています！
I'm thinking of showing you a lot!

980
01:00:49,257 --> 01:00:54,257
あ、メンバーのプレゼントもありがとね！みんなぜひ見ててください！
Oh, and thanks for the membership gifts! Make sure to check them out!

981
01:00:54,757 --> 01:00:57,257
はい、というわけで...
Yes, and with that...

982
01:00:57,257 --> 01:00:59,257
ロボサー、
Robosa,

983
01:00:59,257 --> 01:01:04,757
早いけど、次が最後の曲になっちゃうみたいです。
it's quick, but it seems the next one will be the last song.

984
01:01:05,757 --> 01:01:08,257
僕はもう、9才。
I am already nine years old.

985
01:01:08,757 --> 01:01:14,757
9才になってるよ、ロボサー。ここまで成長を見届けてくれて、ありがとうね。
I'm nine years old, Robosa. Thank you for watching me grow up to this point.

986
01:01:15,757 --> 01:01:23,257
これからもまだまだ僕は成長していくので、一緒に末永く楽しんでいきましょう！
I will keep growing from here on, so let's keep enjoying together for a long time to come!

987
01:01:24,257 --> 01:01:29,257
最後の曲は、はじめにチラッと言っててんけど...
The last song, I mentioned it briefly at the beginning, but...

988
01:01:30,257 --> 01:01:34,757
ドラゴンくんに乗りたいな！
I want to ride on the dragon!

989
01:01:35,257 --> 01:01:38,757
一緒に頑張ってくれる？
Will you do your best with me?

990
01:01:38,757 --> 01:01:42,257
ね、ドラゴンくん！
Right, Dragon-kun?

991
01:01:56,257 --> 01:02:00,257
DAN DAN 心魅かれてく
Bit by bit, my heart is charmed

992
01:02:00,257 --> 01:02:03,257
その眩しい笑顔に
by that dazzling smile of yours

993
01:02:03,257 --> 01:02:08,257
果てない暗闇から飛び出そう
Let's break out of this endless darkness

994
01:02:08,257 --> 01:02:11,257
Hold my hand

995
01:02:18,257 --> 01:02:21,257
君と出逢ったとき
When I first met you,

996
01:02:21,257 --> 01:02:24,757
子どもの頃 大切に
I remembered a place

997
01:02:24,757 --> 01:02:31,257
想っていた場所を思い出したんだ
that I cherished as a child.

998
01:02:31,257 --> 01:02:35,257
僕と踊ってくれないか
Won't you dance with me?

999
01:02:35,257 --> 01:02:39,257
光と影の Winding road
On this winding road of light and shadow,

1000
01:02:39,257 --> 01:02:42,257
今でも 奴に夢中なの？
are you still crazy about him?

1001
01:02:42,257 --> 01:02:45,257
少しだけ 振り向きたくなるような
There are times when I feel like turning back...

1002
01:02:45,257 --> 01:02:49,257
時もあるけど
...even just a little, but...

1003
01:02:49,257 --> 01:02:54,257
愛と勇気と 誇りを持って
with love, courage, and pride,

1004
01:02:54,257 --> 01:03:01,257
闘うよ
I will fight!

1005
01:03:01,257 --> 01:03:05,257
DAN DAN 心魅かれてく
Bit by bit, my heart is charmed

1006
01:03:05,257 --> 01:03:08,757
この星の希望のかけら
by these fragments of hope on this planet.

1007
01:03:08,757 --> 01:03:11,457
きっと誰もが
Surely, anyone

1008
01:03:11,457 --> 01:03:15,757
永遠を手に入れたい
wants to possess eternity.

1009
01:03:15,757 --> 01:03:19,257
全然 気にしないフリしても
Even if I pretend not to care at all,

1010
01:03:19,257 --> 01:03:22,757
ほら君に恋してる
look, I'm in love with you.

1011
01:03:22,757 --> 01:03:27,257
果てない暗闇から飛び出そう
Let's break out of this endless darkness

1012
01:03:27,257 --> 01:03:30,257
Hold your hand

1013
01:03:59,257 --> 01:04:02,457
怒った顔も 疲れてる君も好きだけど
I love you when you're angry or tired...

1014
01:04:02,457 --> 01:04:06,057
あんなに飛ばして生きて 大確夫かなと思う
...but I wonder if you're okay, racing through life like that.

1015
01:04:12,457 --> 01:04:15,257
僕は...何気ない仕草に
I am spun around...

1016
01:04:15,257 --> 01:04:20,257
振り回されてる Sea side blue
...by your casual gestures, sea side blue.

1017
01:04:20,757 --> 01:04:26,057
それでも 奴に夢中なの？
But are you still crazy about him?

1018
01:04:26,757 --> 01:04:30,757
もっと聞きたいことがあったのに
There was more I wanted to ask, but...

1019
01:04:30,757 --> 01:04:33,757
二人の会話が 車の音に
...our conversation was drowned out by the cars...

1020
01:04:33,757 --> 01:04:41,757
阻まれて通りに舞うよ
...and it flutters away onto the street.

1021
01:04:41,757 --> 01:04:45,757
DAN DAN 心魅かれてく
Bit by bit, my heart is charmed

1022
01:04:45,757 --> 01:04:49,257
自分でも不思議なんだけど
It's strange even to me, but...

1023
01:04:49,257 --> 01:04:52,757
何かあると すぐに
whenever something happens...

1024
01:04:52,757 --> 01:04:56,757
君に電話したくなる
...I want to call you right away.

1025
01:04:56,757 --> 01:05:00,257
全然 気のないフリしても
Even if I pretend not to be interested at all...

1026
01:05:00,278 --> 01:05:03,678
結局君のことだけ見ていた
In the end, all I ever did was look at you

1027
01:05:03,678 --> 01:05:06,678
海の彼方へ
Let's jump out...

1028
01:05:06,678 --> 01:05:08,778
飛び出そうよ
...to the far ends of the sea!

1029
01:05:08,778 --> 01:05:14,478
Hold my hand

1030
01:05:32,678 --> 01:05:34,778
みんなー！
Everyone!

1031
01:05:34,778 --> 01:05:36,978
ろぼさー！
My Robosa!

1032
01:05:36,978 --> 01:05:39,778
今日は見てくれてありがとう！
Thank you so much for watching today!

1033
01:05:39,778 --> 01:05:41,778
このあとはなんと！
After this, believe it or not...

1034
01:05:41,778 --> 01:05:44,978
メンバー限定でも歌います！
...I'll be singing for members-only too!

1035
01:05:44,978 --> 01:05:48,778
遊びにきてね！
Please come and join me!

1036
01:05:48,778 --> 01:05:51,478
グッズもめっちゃかわちいから
The merch is super cute too,

1037
01:05:51,478 --> 01:05:55,478
ゲットしてくれよな！
so make sure to get some!

1038
01:05:55,478 --> 01:05:59,278
バイバーイ！
Bye-bye!

1039
01:05:59,278 --> 01:06:03,278
なんか君も遅いね、ドラゴンくん
You're kind of slow too, Mr. Dragon.

